# Theme (Otterscale)

Full spec: [`docs/theme.md`](../../docs/theme.md). Implement tokens in `app/globals.css` via Tailwind v4 `@theme`.

## Non‑negotiables

- Canvas `#f6f3f1` (parchment); text `#242424`; borders `#cecac8`.
- Primary filled CTA: `#2b59d1` + parchment/white uppercase mono — one per screen.
- Secondary filled: `#242424`. Ghost: 1px Off-Black border, transparent.
- Headlines: Instrument Serif weight **400** only. Body/UI: IBM Plex Mono.
- Buttons/inputs: 6px radius. Cards: 8px radius, 20px padding.
- Console: left sidebar, single column, no bento grids.
- No card `box-shadow`. Pastels (sky, mint, coral, gold) are decorative washes only.
- Do not use `prefers-color-scheme: dark` for product UI unless explicitly requested.

## Layout

- Content max-width 1432px; sidebar 240px.

## Tailwind usage

Prefer token-backed utilities (`bg-parchment`, `text-off-black`, `bg-lake-blue`, `border-ash`). Avoid Geist neutrals and generic `gray-*`.

## Example — primary button

```tsx
<button
  type="button"
  className="inline-flex h-9 items-center gap-2 rounded-[6px] bg-lake-blue px-4 text-[14px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[-0.025em] text-parchment"
>
  Get started ▸
</button>
```
